{"book":"Acts","chapter":3,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/acts/3","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Now Peter and John went up together into the temple at the hour of prayer, being the ninth hour.","words":[["Now",["G1161"]],["Peter",["G4074"]],["and",["G2532"]],["John",["G2491"]],["went up",["G305"]],["together",["G1909","G846"]],["into",["G1519"]],["the temple",["G2411"]],["at the hour",["G5610"]],["of prayer,",["G4335"]],["being the ninth hour.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"And a certain man lame from his mother’s womb was carried, whom they laid daily at the gate of the temple which is called Beautiful, to ask alms of them that entered into the temple;","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["a certain",["G5100"]],["man",["G435"]],["lame",["G5225","G5560"]],["from",["G1537"]],["his",["G846"]],["mother’s womb",["G2836"]],["was carried,",["G941"]],["whom",["G3739"]],["they laid",["G5087"]],["daily",["G2250","G2596"]],["at",["G4314"]],["the gate",["G2374"]],["of the temple",["G2411"]],["which",["G3588"]],["is called",["G3004"]],["Beautiful,",["G5611"]],["to ask",["G154"]],["alms",["G1654"]],["of",["G3844"]],["them that entered",["G1531"]],["into",["G1519"]],["the temple;",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"Who seeing Peter and John about to go into the temple asked an alms.","words":[["Who",["G3739"]],["seeing",["G1492"]],["Peter",["G4074"]],["and",["G2532"]],["John",["G2491"]],["about",["G3195"]],["to go",["G1524"]],["into",["G1519"]],["the temple",["G2411"]],["asked",["G2065","G2983"]],["an alms.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"And Peter, fastening his eyes upon him with John, said, Look on us.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["Peter,",["G4074"]],["fastening his eyes",["G816"]],["upon",["G1519"]],["him",["G846"]],["with",["G4862"]],["John,",["G2491"]],["said,",["G2036"]],["Look",["G991"]],["on",["G1519"]],["us.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"And he gave heed unto them, expecting to receive something of them.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["he gave heed",["G1907"]],["unto them,",["G846"]],["expecting",["G4328"]],["to receive",["G2983"]],["something",["G5100"]],["of",["G3844"]],["them.",[]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"Then Peter said, Silver and gold have I none; but such as I have give I thee: In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth rise up and walk.","words":[["Then",["G1161"]],["Peter",["G4074"]],["said,",["G2036"]],["Silver",["G694"]],["and",["G2532"]],["gold",["G5553"]],["have",["G5225"]],["I",["G3427"]],["none;",["G3756"]],["but",["G1161"]],["such as",["G3739","G5124"]],["I have",["G2192"]],["give I",["G1325"]],["thee:",["G4671"]],["In",["G1722"]],["the name",["G3686"]],["of Jesus",["G2424"]],["Christ",["G5547"]],["of Nazareth",["G3480"]],["rise up",["G1453"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walk.",[]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"And he took him by the right hand, and lifted him up: and immediately his feet and ankle bones received strength.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["he took",["G4084"]],["him",["G846"]],["by the right",["G1188"]],["hand,",["G5495"]],["and lifted him up:",["G1453"]],["and",["G1161"]],["immediately",["G3916"]],["his",["G846"]],["feet",["G939"]],["and",["G2532"]],["ankle bones",["G4974"]],["received strength.",[]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"And he leaping up stood, and walked, and entered with them into the temple, walking, and leaping, and praising God.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["he leaping up",["G1814"]],["stood,",["G2476"]],["and",["G2532"]],["walked,",["G4043"]],["and",["G2532"]],["entered",["G1525"]],["with",["G4862"]],["them",["G846"]],["into",["G1519"]],["the temple,",["G2411"]],["walking,",["G4043"]],["and",["G2532"]],["leaping,",["G242"]],["and",["G2532"]],["praising",["G134"]],["God.",[]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"And all the people saw him walking and praising God:","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["all",["G3956"]],["the people",["G2992"]],["saw",["G1492"]],["him",["G846"]],["walking",["G4043"]],["and",["G2532"]],["praising",["G134"]],["God:",[]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"And they knew that it was he which sat for alms at the Beautiful gate of the temple: and they were filled with wonder and amazement at that which had happened unto him.","words":[["And",["G5037"]],["they knew",["G1921"]],["that",["G3754"]],["it",["G846"]],["was",["G2258"]],["he",["G3778"]],["which",["G3588"]],["sat",["G2521"]],["for",["G4314"]],["alms",["G1654"]],["at",["G1909"]],["the Beautiful",["G5611"]],["gate",["G4439"]],["of the temple:",["G2411"]],["and",["G2532"]],["they were filled",["G4130"]],["with wonder",["G2285"]],["and",["G2532"]],["amazement",["G1611"]],["at",["G1909"]],["that which had happened",["G4819"]],["unto him.",[]]]},{"verse":11,"text":"And as the lame man which was healed held Peter and John, all the people ran together unto them in the porch that is called Solomon’s, greatly wondering.","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["as the lame man",["G5560"]],["which was healed",["G2390"]],["held",["G2902"]],["Peter",["G4074"]],["and",["G2532"]],["John,",["G2491"]],["all",["G3956"]],["the people",["G2992"]],["ran together",["G4936"]],["unto",["G4314"]],["them",["G846"]],["in",["G1909"]],["the porch",["G4745"]],["that is called",["G2564"]],["Solomon’s, greatly wondering.",[]]]},{"verse":12,"text":"And when Peter saw it, he answered unto the people, Ye men of Israel, why marvel ye at this? or why look ye so earnestly on us, as though by our own power or holiness we had made this man to walk?","words":[["And",["G1161"]],["when Peter",["G4074"]],["saw",["G1492"]],["it, he answered",["G611"]],["unto",["G4314"]],["the people,",["G2992"]],["Ye men",["G435"]],["of Israel,",["G2475"]],["why",["G5101"]],["marvel ye",["G2296"]],["at",["G1909"]],["this?",["G5129"]],["or",["G2228"]],["why",["G5101"]],["look ye so earnestly",["G816"]],["on us,",["G2254"]],["as though",["G5613"]],["by our own",["G2398"]],["power",["G1411"]],["or",["G2228"]],["holiness",["G2150"]],["we had made",["G4160"]],["this man",["G846"]],["to walk?",[]]]},{"verse":13,"text":"The God of Abraham, and of Isaac, and of Jacob, the God of our fathers, hath glorified his Son Jesus; whom ye delivered up, and d